WEBVTT

00:00:00.584 --> 00:00:03.947
Narrator: When it's an emergency, there's a signal for that.

00:00:04.171 --> 00:00:07.198
Narrator: Faisal crosses both arms above his head: emergency.

00:00:11.094 --> 00:00:14.012
Narrator: Noura sees it and passes it on straight away.

00:00:14.206 --> 00:00:16.443
Narrator: Faisal moves people away from the bin.
